text = "\"Welcome to Farmlandia

The farm has fallen into disrepair and the farmers need your help. Three farmers have important tasks that need to be completed:

- Farmer Bob needs help collecting vegetables from the field
- Farmer Jane needs assistance whacking the moles stealing the vegetables
- Farmer Joe needs someone brave to help protect his sheep from the wolves

Complete all three tasks to save the farm and become the hero of Farmlandia

Can you help save the farm?\""

